# lib/ layout and domain models

Target structure (migrate gradually):

- `lib/app/` — app shell, router, theme, l10n
- `lib/core/` — shared config, storage, utils
- `lib/features/` — product screens (dashboard, nodes, settings, …)
- `lib/fluxa/` — adapters, parsers, providers, **Fluxa models**
- `lib/legacy/flclash/` — upstream-aligned code when needed

## FluxaNode (concept)

Unified node abstraction; must not hard-depend on FlClash proxy types in UI.

## Single-node / subscription import

```text
Input → Parser (fluxa/parsers) → FluxaNode → Storage → Mihomo/FlClash adapter
```

Example: `vless://` → VLESS parser → `FluxaNode` → adapter → Mihomo config.

Support over time: URL sub, local YAML/JSON, provider, and protocols (VLESS, VMess, Trojan, SS, Hysteria(2), TUIC, …).

## UI

Fluxa-owned screens and copy; no FlClash branding in new UI (except open-source credits in About).
